{"id":222,"date":"2015-10-22T00:12:42","date_gmt":"2015-10-22T00:12:42","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.localhost:8888\/wordpress\/?p=222"},"modified":"2015-11-16T17:25:25","modified_gmt":"2015-11-16T17:25:25","slug":"poker-night-in-america-announces-sponsorship-deal-with-888poker","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/pokernight.com\/poker-night-in-america-announces-sponsorship-deal-with-888poker\/","title":{"rendered":"Poker Night in America Announces Sponsorship Deal with 888Poker"},"content":{"rendered":"<h1><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/pokernight.com\/sites\/pokernight.com\/files\/sites\/pokernight.com\/files\/blog\/888_Facebook.jpg\" alt=\"\" \/><\/h1>\n<h1>Poker Night in America Announces Sponsorship Deal with 888Poker<\/h1>\n<p><strong>Las Vegas, NV (June 15, 2014) <\/strong>&#8211; <em>&#8220;Poker Night in America&#8221;<\/em> (PNIA), an exciting new weekly television series scheduled to debut nationally in Summer 2014  announced today the signing of an official sponsorship agreement with the All-American Poker Network (AAPN).  AAPN, which will target the regulated United States online gaming market, is a joint venture between 888 Holdings (888) &#8212; one of the world&#8217;s leading online gaming operators &#8212; and Avenue Capital Group (ACG) &#8211; one of the world&#8217;s leading investment firms.<\/p>\n<p>888Poker is already a well-known and highly-trusted brand in the online gaming world.  Leveraging 888&#8217;s award-winning software and management services has enabled the 888Poker brand to become the world&#8217;s second-largest online poker network.  Moreover,<a href=\"http:\/\/us.888poker.com\/\"> us.888Poker.com<\/a> has become the third-largest independent poker room in the state of New Jersey.  888Poker is operated under a license issued by the New Jersey Division of Gaming Enforcement (NJDGE).<\/p>\n<p>888Poker is also bucking industry trends by continuing to grow domestically and worldwide.  Over the past year 888Poker has experienced 10 percent growth versus and overall industry decline of 9 percent worldwide.  <em>Source:  Pokerscout March 2014<\/em><\/p>\n<p>This agreement represents a unique cooperative alliance in both gaming and entertainment and which increases the potential for further expansion.<em>  &#8220;Poker Night in America,&#8221; <\/em>which is produced by Rush Street Productions, is currently in the midst of filming and releasing its first full season of new shows.  The production team recently announced a national television deal with CBS Sports which will broadcast <em>&#8220;Poker Night in America&#8221; <\/em>weekly on Sunday nights. The first show debuts this Sunday, June 29<sup>th<\/sup>.<\/p>\n<span class=\"et_bloom_bottom_trigger\"><\/span>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Poker Night in America Announces Sponsorship Deal with 888Poker Las Vegas, NV (June 15, 2014) &#8211; &#8220;Poker Night in America&#8221; (PNIA), an exciting new weekly television series scheduled to debut nationally in Summer 2014 announced today the signing of an official sponsorship agreement with the All-American Poker Network (AAPN). AAPN, which will target the regulated [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":223,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_et_pb_use_builder":"","_et_pb_old_content":"","_et_gb_content_width":"","_exactmetrics_skip_tracking":false,"_exactmetrics_sitenote_active":false,"_exactmetrics_sitenote_note":"","_exactmetrics_sitenote_category":0,"footnotes":""},"categories":[13],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-222","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-blog"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.3 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Poker Night in America Announces Sponsorship Deal with 888Poker - Poker Night in America<\/title>\n<meta n